  "term": "progressive muscle relaxation",
  "definition": "Progressive muscle relaxation is a relaxation skill or practice that can be taught for self-use, sometimes together with music listening. In the source, it is used as an intervention aimed at easing anxiety, depression, and stress and improving quality of life.",
